{"ID":"20230926142138-fxx56qh","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926142138-fxx56qh","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142138-fxx56qh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142141-o630hbx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142141-6e1skyf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926142141-6e1skyf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:35,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:35\u0026#125;","title":"【茯苓饮】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926142141"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926142141-o630hbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142141-o630hbx","updated":"20230926142141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：茯苓、人参、白术各三两；枳实二两、橘皮二两半、生姜四两"}]},{"ID":"20230926142141-v7chki5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142141-v7chki5","updated":"20230926142141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右六味，水六升，煮取一升八合，分温三服，如人行八九里进之。"}]},{"ID":"20230926142141-6e1skyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926142141-6e1skyf","updated":"20230926142141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治心胸中有停痰宿水，自吐出水后，心胸间虚，气满不能食。消痰气，令能食。"}]}]}